      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.chattanoogan.com/2025/8/27/507716/The-Creeker-Magazine-Featuring-History.aspx"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s mail trains ran from 1880 to 1967, delivering letters via steam locomotives before diesel RPO cars took over.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.chattanoogan.com/2025/8/27/507716/The-Creeker-Magazine-Featuring-History.aspx"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1992, Curtis Coulter produced a historical calendar that listed every notable event that ever happened in Sale Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
