      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.einpresswire.com/article/535444840/an-excursion-to-the-past-a-historical-journey-of-sale-creek-and-coulterville-tn"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Coulter also authored a 2021 book, *An Excursion to the Past*, detailing Sale Creek’s history from 1775 to today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
